/*
:name: keyword_as_identifier
:type: error
:error: cannot be a variable name
:help: wrap it in backticks
*/
// A reserved word is not a name on its own. `stage` (the `stage[N]` pipelining
// modifier) is only a variable when written `` `stage` `` -- see
// keyword_escaped_identifier for the form that compiles.
//
// Provenance: bedrock's br_delay_valid names its shift register `stage`, and a
// Verilog signal named `in`/`reg` is just as ordinary, so this is what someone
// hand-writing the Pyrope for an imported design reaches for first. The
// diagnostic has to name the word and show the escape.
pub mod repro(a:u8) -> (o:u8@[0]) {
  reg stage:[2]u8 = 0

  stage[0] = a
  o = stage[1]
}
